<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13545" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dētractĭo</span></b> ,
			ōnis, f.
		detraho, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a drawing off, taking away, withdrawal</i>.
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> In gen. (good prose): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">alieni, opp. appetitio,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Off. 3, 6, 30</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">doloris,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 3, 33, 118</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">loci,</span>”
				<i>departure from</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Att. 12, 35</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sanguinis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cels. 4,
					4</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Quint. 2, 10, 6</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 17,
				26, 39, § 246</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">illa ipsa (sc. Praxitelia capita) efficiuntur
					detractione,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Div. 2, 21, 48</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> In
			partic. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<b>Medic. t. t.</b>, <i>a purging</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cibi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic. Univ. 6</span></i>
			.—More freq. <i>absol.</i>, <i><span class="en">Cels. 2,
			10</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Scrib. Comp. 101</span></i> et
			saep.—In plur., <i><span class="en">Vitr. 1,
			6</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 16, 44, 92, § 244</span></i>; <i><span class="en">22, 25, 64, §
			133</span></i>.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			Rhet. t. t., <i>a taking away, leaving out,
			ellipsis</i>, <i><span class="en">Quint. 1, 5, 38</span></i>; <i><span class="en">9, 2, 37
			al.</span></i>—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>C.</b>
			<i>Detraction, slander, evil-speaking</i>, <i><span class="en">Vulg. Sap. 1,
				11</span></i>.—<i>Plur.</i>, <i><span class="en">id. 2 Cor.
				12, 20</span></i>.</div>
